[{"id":"e13-baseline-first","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十三)多Agent评测.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十三)多Agent评测","articlePath":"posts/25213184/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十三)多Agent评测.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十三)多Agent评测","articlePath":"posts/25213184/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么在“级联失败”的课程边界中要先建立基线？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先固定baseline、handoff和global，再记录故意破坏一个 handoff，对比单体、分工和投票轨迹，解释全局失败。的基线分布；否则无法判断新增复杂度是否带来收益。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>多 Agent 评测先留单体基线，再检查交接、投票和级联失败；局部 Agent 成功不等于全局任务成功 需要在相同环境、版本和失败样本上比较。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-flaky-retry-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["pytest","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付","articlePath":"posts/bdd9d1a1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付","articlePath":"posts/bdd9d1a1/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候可以对 Appium 用例重试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>只对已确认的瞬时环境错误有限重试，并保留首次失败；确定性的断言、定位和数据污染不能靠重试掩盖。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>flaky\u003c/code> 用来描述“代码和输入没有改变，但同一用例有时通过、有时失败”的不稳定现象。重试前定义失败分类、次数和证据字段；设备短暂 \u003ccode>offline\u003c/code> 可以重连并标为环境问题，业务断言失败应直接保存工件并修复根因。重试后通过也要保留首次失败和 flaky 趋势，不能把偶然成功当成稳定通过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-anr-evidence","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["稳定性","ANR"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>出现“页面卡住”时，为什么不能只保存录屏？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>录屏只能证明用户看到的现象，还要结合操作时间、主线程状态、logcat 和系统报告判断是否为 ANR。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“页面卡住”只是用户看到的现象，可能来自网络等待、渲染掉帧、业务状态错误，也可能是真正的 ANR (Application Not Responding, 应用无响应)。\u003ccode>logcat\u003c/code> 用来查看系统和 App 在操作前后的日志，\u003ccode>dumpsys\u003c/code> 用来读取 Android 系统服务的状态快照，\u003ccode>traces\u003c/code> 用来查看 ANR 时各线程停在哪里；三者分别补充时间线、系统状态和线程调用栈。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>例如主线程停在锁等待或同步网络调用，\u003ccode>traces\u003c/code> 能显示等待位置；只有接口响应慢而主线程仍能处理输入，则更接近服务端或网络问题。保存操作时间、前后 \u003ccode>logcat\u003c/code>、相关 \u003ccode>dumpsys\u003c/code> 和必要的 traces，才能区分应用 ANR、服务端慢和测试环境失效，不能把录屏中的卡顿直接写成 ANR。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["DNS","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":17,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>DNS 返回了 IP，为什么访问仍然失败？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>DNS 只完成名称到地址的解析，后续仍可能在路由、ARP/ND、TCP/QUIC、TLS、HTTP 或服务端策略处失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>把解析、连接、安全握手和应用响应分开测试，才能知道失败停在哪一层。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>一次解析至少包含两个角色：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>角色\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>负责什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>递归解析器\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>代客户端沿 DNS 层级查询并缓存结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>权威服务器\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>对自己负责的区域给出最终记录\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此“DNS 返回了 IP”只结束名称解析；路由、连接、TLS 和应用响应仍要分别验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["QUIC","UDP","TLS 1.3"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>QUIC 为什么不能简单理解为“没有连接的 UDP”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>QUIC 在 UDP 上实现了连接 ID、确认、丢包恢复、拥塞控制、独立流和加密，并集成 TLS 1.3 握手。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>UDP 只提供无连接的数据报发送入口；QUIC 在这些数据报之上自己维护连接 ID、确认、丢包恢复、拥塞控制、独立 stream (逻辑数据流) 和 TLS 1.3 加密。HTTP/3 再把 HTTP 语义映射到 QUIC，因此“使用 UDP”不等于没有连接、可靠性或安全状态。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以按职责看这一层关系：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>层\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>负责什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>UDP\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传送数据报，不保证顺序和重传\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>QUIC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>连接状态、可靠传输、拥塞控制、并发 stream 和 TLS\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP/3\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>方法、状态、字段等 HTTP 语义\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>QUIC 的连接状态由 QUIC 自己维护，而不是由 UDP 提供；所以不能因为抓到 UDP 包就把它当成普通、无状态的 UDP 应用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-pwd-realpath","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["路径","符号链接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>pwd、readlink -f 和 realpath 的关注点有什么不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>pwd 看当前工作目录；readlink -f 和 realpath 解析路径中的符号链接并给出物理落点。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三者回答的问题不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">pwd\u003c/span>                 \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前 Shell 的工作目录\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$PWD\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 保留 Shell 记录的逻辑路径\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">readlink\u003c/span> -f ./link  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 解析符号链接后的物理落点\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">realpath\u003c/span> ./link     \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 同样用于得到规范化路径\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果用户要求记录“从哪个链接进入”，保留逻辑路径；只有判断挂载点、比较 inode 或定位真实文件时才解析。无条件规范化会丢掉这个上下文。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a3-df-du","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["容量","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>磁盘空间告急时为什么要同时看 df 和 du？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>df 看文件系统层面的可用块，du 汇总目录可见文件；打开后删除的文件或其他挂载边界可能让两者不一致。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两个命令观察的层次不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">df\u003c/span> -h .              \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 文件系统还剩多少块\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">du\u003c/span> -xhd1 .           \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前挂载点下各目录可见文件的占用\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">lsof +L1 2&gt;/dev/null \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 已删除但仍被进程打开的文件（若系统提供 lsof）\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>df\u003c/code> 看到的是文件系统账本，\u003ccode>du\u003c/code> 只能遍历当前目录树。文件已经 unlink 但进程仍持有描述符、目录下还有另一个挂载点，都会让 \u003ccode>df\u003c/code> 明显大于 \u003ccode>du\u003c/code>；这时继续查打开文件和挂载边界，而不是盲目删除目录。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-08-sargable-rewrite-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["SARGable","日期范围","索引"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化","articlePath":"posts/3bb0fc53/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化","articlePath":"posts/3bb0fc53/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>WHERE DATE(ordered_at) = &#39;2026-07-01&#39;\u003c/code> 可能导致索引失效，如何改写并说明边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id, ordered_at, total_amount\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-07-01&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-07-02&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>对列调用 \u003ccode>DATE()\u003c/code> 会先计算每一行的表达式，优化器不一定能直接按原列索引定位。半开区间把同一天写成两个边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2026-07-01 00:00:00 &lt;= ordered_at &lt; 2026-07-02 00:00:00\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>左边包含、右边排除，不依赖“当天最后一秒”的精度。若业务时区不是数据库存储时区，先把输入边界转换后再执行；否则执行计划可能正确，结果仍会错一天。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-06-consecutive-login-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["连续登录","Gaps-and-Islands","窗口函数"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何计算每个用户最长连续登录天数，并忽略同一天多次登录？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WITH\u003c/span> days \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DISTINCT\u003c/span> user_id, \u003cspan class=\"type\">DATE\u003c/span>(logged_at) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> login_day \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> login_events \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> success \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">numbered \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> user_id, login_day,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">         TO_DAYS(login_day) \u003cspan class=\"operator\">-\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ROW_NUMBER\u003c/span>() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">OVER\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PARTITION\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> login_day) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> island\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> days\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> user_id, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">MAX\u003c/span>(streak) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> longest_streak\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> user_id, island, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> streak \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> numbered \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id, island) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> s\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> user_id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“日期减行号”只在每个用户每天最多一行时成立，所以先去重：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">成功日期：01, 01, 02, 04\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">DISTINCT  → 01, 02, 04\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">行号：       1   2   3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">日期-行号：  0   0   1  → 两个连续岛\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>再按岛计数取最大值。用户 1 的最长连续自然日是 2，用户 2 没有成功登录不应补造记录；如果业务要算“连续 24 小时”，就不能用 \u003ccode>DATE()\u003c/code> 的自然日模型。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a09-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["状态覆盖","转换覆盖"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>状态覆盖是否等于转换覆盖？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不等于。状态覆盖只证明进入过每个状态，转换覆盖还要求每条合法边及其守卫都被执行。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>一个订单进入过“已支付”不代表测试过支付超时、重复支付或从退款中恢复。把状态节点、事件边、守卫条件和非法转换分开列出，分别绑定用例与证据；否则很容易只走成功路径。状态机还要说明终态和副作用，不能由页面标签推断数据库或支付状态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]